[EXAMPLES]
Convert all records to XML:

  rec2xml contacts.rec

Convert only a specific record type:

  rec2xml -t Task todo.rec

Sort the output by a field:

  rec2xml -S Name contacts.rec

[SEE ALSO]
.BR rec2json (1),
